# TODO: authenticity check — baptism details.

You were baptized in the spring, at the assembly, in front of everyone.
{GameState.parent_word} cried the whole way through the talk. {GameState.sibling_name} filmed it on his phone, and then, you found out later, left before the afternoon session.
You're twenty-two. You live at home. You work days at a print shop, and you're good at it, and it doesn't matter much.
What matters is here: the Hall on Sundays and Tuesdays, the car group on Saturday mornings, the friends.
{GameState.player_title} {GameState.player_name}. You're still getting used to hearing it.
It's the first Sunday of the month.
